# Pneumonia Detection from Chest X-Ray Images

## Overview
This project uses Convolutional Neural Networks (CNN) to detect pneumonia from chest X-ray images.

## Technologies
- Python
- TensorFlow / Keras
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

## Dataset
Chest X-Ray Pneumonia dataset from Kaggle.

## Model Architecture
CNN with Conv2D, MaxPooling, Dropout, and Dense layers.

## Results
Accuracy achieved: ~93%

## Visualizations
- Training Accuracy vs Epochs
- Loss vs Epochs
- Confusion Matrix